Subject: [PATCH 1/7] WhatsApp setup: document the Cloud API registration step

SMS/voice OTP only proves ownership of the number; WhatsApp Manager
keeps it "Pending" until a separate call to the registration API
succeeds. Not previously written down, and easy to mistake for the
verification failing.

